Retail Store Sales Performance Analysis
Project Overview
This project analyzes retail sales data to identify revenue trends, profitable product categories, regional performance, and customer payment preferences.
Tools & Technologies
- Microsoft Excel – Data cleaning, formulas, and PivotTables
- MySQL – Data analysis using SQL queries
- Power BI – Interactive dashboard and visualizations
Dataset
- 300 sales records
- Sales data from 2025
- Includes region, city, product, category, quantity, pricing, payment mode, and sales channel.
Key Performance Indicators
- **Total Revenue:** ₹10,78,800
- **Total Profit:** ₹4,77,335
- **Total Orders:** 300
- **Average Order Value:** ₹3,596
Analysis Performed
- Regional sales performance
- Revenue by product category
- Top-performing products
- Monthly revenue trends
- Sales channel performance
- Payment mode analysis
- Profitability analysis
Project Files
- Excel workbook
- Raw CSV dataset
- MySQL queries
- Power BI dashboard
- Dashboard screenshot
Objective
To demonstrate practical skills in data cleaning, spreadsheet analysis, SQL querying, business intelligence, and data visualization.

Note: This project uses a sample synthetic dataset created for learning and portfolio demonstration.
